window.products.push({"id":901004,"name":"Harry Potter Flowers & Roses Dozen- one of a kind First Anniversary gift, Paper Flowers Bouquet, Book Flowers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NrohrG2FL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"An elegant collection of Harry Potter book pages and crimson red paper folded into 3 roses and 9 flowers, wrapped into this beautiful bouquet. The 9 traditional flowers are printed with pages from Harry Potter books with a handpainted red edge and pearl embellishment. The bouquet is securely wrapped with red satin ribbon. The bouquet measures approximately 7 inches in diameter and over 12 inches tall. *Vase can be added while checking out* The bouquet shown here has been sold and a new bouquet will be created for you once you've made your purchase! As you check out you'll choose the accent color for the edges of the text flower and the roses. Please allow 3 days for the production of your customized bouquet!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NrohrG2FL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dana's Paper Flowers","source_asin":"B0851R539G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0851R539G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0851R539G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
