window.products.push({"id":901006,"name":"DIY Home Decoration Glass Stickers Window Film Skull Deer Animal Skull with Floral Horns Nature Inspired Dead and Living Art Print Cream Pink Brown 17","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6161+C-C+3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of buying expensive drapes and blinds just to protect your privacy? Do you have beautiful windows that you really don't even want to cover up? Our beautiful glass sticker can help you solve this problem. It is self adhesive which is very easy to apply, virtually mess-free and there's no glue, so it's removable!Size: 17.7\" x 39\"What Included: 1 roll window filmQuick Tips:Step1: Clean the glassStep2: Wet glass with soapy water (or just clear water also work well)Step3: Remove from backing protect sheet ( which is a kind of clear vinyl, please MAKE SURE remove it before you apply the window film to glass)Step4: Apply to wet glass and smooth with handsStep5: Squeegee away water and air bubbles.How to tear off the backing quickly?A: Please try at corner and attach Scotch Tape on both sides of the window film to separate, then it will be easily removed away.Tips:1. Because the sticker is big, so we will ship it roll up. There may be some wrinkles on the sides of the sticker, but it doesn't influence the decor effect on the wall, please know this in advance, thanks!2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before using and apply the smooth side of film to glass. Otherwise it will not be firmly adhered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6161+C-C+3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homesonne","source_asin":"B097H86ZVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097H86ZVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097H86ZVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
