window.products.push({"id":901016,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser, 350ML Hand Soap Dispenser Wall Mount, USB Charging Touchless Hands Free Foaming Dish Soap Dispenser for Kitchen, Bathroom, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618mTocyvtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TOUCHLESS SMART SENSITIVE SENSOR DESIGN, PROVIDES EASY HYGIENIC DISPENSING OF SOAP --- This automatic soap dispenser is designed with the newest automatic sensor technology, built-in high interference immunity, free from infrared interference. You can get the soap by your hand without touch. This automatic hand sanitizer dispenser provides for easy, hygienic dispensing of soap. CONVENIENT, MAKES HAND-WASHING FUN FOR KIDS --- Normally pump soap dispenser looks dirty, because your are pumping it with dirty hands. Especially with raw food on your hand, when it used as a kitchen soap dispenser. With this hands free soap dispenser, you just need stick your hand under the spout and like magic, soap falls into the palm of your hand. Convenient and fun, especially for kids. Best choice as dish soap dispenser for kitchen. 2 MODE AUTOMATIC HAND SANITIZER DISPENSER --- This foaming soap dispenser will pumps 1ML each time when the red indicator light is on. If you need more, second short press the button till the blue indicator light on, the kitchen soap dispenser will give more foaming. 2 inches is the best distance to sensitive. ATTENTION: Foaming hand sanitizer can be added directly, liquid hand sanitizer need to be mixed with water at a ratio of 1:3. 350ML LARGE CAPACITY TRANSPARENT CONTAINER, CAN BE PUT ON TABLE OR WALL MOUNTED --- This soap dispenser for kitchen sink can hold 350ML/ 11.8 Ounces liquid soap, and the touchless hand sanitizer dispenser can be placed on the table or wall-mounted where you like, as kitchen, hotel, hospital, office, school, and other public place, without installation requirement. Perfect used as dish soap dispenser, bathroom shampoo/ hand soap dispenser. USB CHARGING, RECHARGEABLE, IP4 WATERPROOF, NO LEAKAGE --- This touchless soap dispenser was built-in rechargeable lithium battery, can be used for 2-4 months after fully charged in 2-4 hours. Energy-saving and environment-friendly, no need to replace batteries frequently. Waterproof base electric dispenser can effectively prevent water from dipping the battery box. Special sealed bottle mouth design, can effectively prevent leakage when pouring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618mTocyvtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zwish","source_asin":"B089W8G9YB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089W8G9YB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089W8G9YB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
