window.products.push({"id":901111,"name":"Ethos Natura 100% Eucalyptus Tencel Lyocell Cooling Pillowcases (2pc), Silky Soft & Smooth Pillow Cases, Sustainably Made, Sensitive Skin & Acne Pillo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Igkt7VoOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUSTAINABLY MADE & CERTIFIED – Our eco-friendly pillowcases are made of 100% Eucalyptus Certified TENCEL Lyocell fibers from Austria. Our environmentally responsible, closed loop production process uses renewable forests and recycles water at a recovery rate of more than 99%, ultimately saving water and energy. They are USDA Certified Biobased and Ecolabel Certified – i.e. they are plant derived. They are also certified as compostable and biodegradable, and thus can fully revert back to nature. SILKY SMOOTH & SOFT – These eucalyptus pillow cases are made with a sateen weave and a luxurious sheen – giving them a silky smooth and naturally soft feeling that will carry you into absolute bliss. NATURALLY COOLING – Tencel pillowcases are exceptionally breathable, temperature regulating, and moisture-wicking - making them the best cooling pillowcases whether you’re a hot sleeper, have night sweats or just want to sleep in complete luxury. In fact, they naturally absorb & wick away moisture 70% better than cotton & they are 3x softer. GENTLE ON SKIN & HYPOALLERGENIC – Our eucalyptus Tencel pillow cases are perfect for everyone, but if you have sensitive skin, acne prone skin or allergies, these are your perfect pillowcases. Normal cotton fibers trap sweat, moisture and grime while you sleep, creating the perfect breeding ground for breakouts. Tencel pillowcases will let you sleep comfortably all night long and wake up with glowing skin! WHAT’S INCLUDED? – Silky soft and naturally smooth pillowcases made from 100% eucalyptus certified TENCEL Lyocell – comes in 2 pieces","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Igkt7VoOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ethos Natura","source_asin":"B096HFTW8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096HFTW8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096HFTW8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
