window.products.push({"id":901304,"name":"DKC Knives DKC-699-ST-BH-DS BUFFALO HORN LAGUIOLE STEAK Utility KNIFE Damascus Steel 9\" Long 4.5\" Blade (4\" Sharp Area) Approx 5oz 100% Hand Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815JY+j2HVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DKC Laguiole Steak Knives Top Rated Knives: DKC Knives provides custom hand made Damascus Steel Folding and Fixed Blade Knives. Our knives range from hunting knives, pocket folding knives, Laguiole knives,, Skinner Knives, Gut Hook Knives, Chef Knives, Kukri Knives, Ulu Knives, Scrimshaw Knives, fishing knives, and many other specialty knives. Our knives come with a sheath. Final pieces (both the knife and sheath) may have variances from the pictures due to being hand made, natural materials, the time of day we make the knife, etc. This is the beauty of hand made knifes. Each knife takes many hours of hard work to produce..these are not machined knives ! You are getting both a piece of art as well as a functional knife ! If you care for your DKC Knife properly, it will be a family heirloom that can be handed down. In addition we offer a growing list of pocket folding knives and fixed blade knives made in 440c stainless steel and other blade materials. Natural materials (wood, bone, etc) can shift over time due to temperature and humidity....so pieces that are not a machine fit are not defects, but rather part of the natural material characteristics. DKC Knives come well lubricated (typically in oil) and need to be wiped down with a soft microfiber cloth when you receive the knife. Knives include instructions for knife care. If you have any questions or issues please contact us and we are happy to help you. We work extremely hard to put out nice knives at a reasonable price. We are a small business located here in the US and depend on your ongoing support with new knife purchases and good reviews. Please join our growing list of world wide knife collectors. Buy two or three different models and you will become hooked as many people do. Our knives are great gifts for fathers day, birthdays, graduations, anniversaries as well as many other occasions . A beautiful hand made custom knife will be remembered forever ! Thanks from all of us at DKC Knives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815JY+j2HVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DKC Knives","source_asin":"B07R6J961V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R6J961V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R6J961V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901305,"name":"KingBeast Rolling Meat Tenderizer Tool | 36 Razor Sharp Stainless Steel Steak Tenderizer Knife Blades Perfectly Tenderizes Steak, Chicken, Beef, Pork,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlSNOteVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"I’m fortunate because my work as a chef has allowed me to sample mouthwatering cuisine in 17 countries around the world. And while I loved sampling new menus, my mid-section didn’t. My clothes grew tighter and tighter, my health took a swift downhill dive, and I didn’t like how I looked in the mirror. Something had to change. But like most people who wish to lose weight I was convinced I had to not only suffer from the discomfort of feeling hungry but also having to give up the foods I love. I WAS WRONG!! As a Scandinavian native I was somewhat familiar with a Swedish invented diet called LCHF (low-carb-high-fat) that has helped Scandinavians stay HEALTHY and FIT for decades. I knew that on this diet I had to give up things like hamburgers, pizza, sandwiches (I love bread), cakes, ice cream, pasta, potatoes and other foods with high carb content. OR SO I THOUGHT… I DISCOVERED HOW TO MAKE BAD FOOD GOOD and how to KEEP EATING all those things, feeling FULL and SATISFIED after every meal, and still have the WEIGHT practically FALL OFF ME.= Since all kinds of meat is perfect for the Scandinavial Lifestyle I knew I needed to get a tenderizer to SAVE cooking time. I wasn’t satisfied with what I could find online so I decided to create my own. I had to look half way across the globe before I found the MOTHER OF ALL TENDERIZERS. A tool small enough to handle a chicken breast and POWERFUL enough to take on an entire steak. This tool has SAVED me 100’s of HOURS OF time in the kitchen. It even makes it easy to fry a full chicken breast in only 5 minutes! I am convinced that you will find this tool so INDESPENSIBLE that I will offer you not only a LIFETIME warranty but also a risk FREE 60 day money back guarantee. LOVE it or your money back, no questions asked.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlSNOteVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scandinavian lifestyle diet","source_asin":"B075KLV49R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075KLV49R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075KLV49R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901306,"name":"TANG PIN Moonlight Deer Ceramic Tea Cup with Infuser and Wooden Handle Steeping Mug 13.5 OZ (Pink&Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WkBB5AlPS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fantastic implication: Moon and deer represent that Christmas is coming. Deer, the God of Nature and freedom. Moon, reunion. Practical Design: The cup is made of ceramic with wooden handle. Approximately size: 3.1*4.9*5.6 inch. Volume: 13.5 OZ. Lid keeps your drink clean and can be used as a coaster for the infuser. The wooden handle prevents your hand from being scalded. Multi-functional mug: Put the loose tea into the filter to brew tea. Or just take out the filter, use the ceramic cup for coffee, drink or water. Unique design and functional mug make it perfect gift for housewarming, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas gift and Father’s Day, etc. We are comitted to supply high quality cups. Please feel free to contact us for any problems regarding the ceramic cup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WkBB5AlPS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TANG PIN","source_asin":"B08HWR1P5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HWR1P5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HWR1P5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901307,"name":"iWavecube IW600SIL 600-Watt Personal Desktop Microwave Oven, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jjREWk+-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The iWavecube is the world's smallest microwave yet boasts 600-watt of power. It's so small and light, there's even a handle on it. The patented iWavecube measures 10-1/2-inch wide by 12-inch high by 10-inch deep. By taking up less than one cubic foot of space and weighing only 12-pound, you can put the portable iWavecube anywhere in your home including the family room, or the sacred \"Man Cave\". It’s extremely quiet. In only a few minutes, the iWavecube zaps popcorn, coffee, soup, and pocket sandwiches. The iWavecube is small and light enough to be called the world’s first personal microwave, which means that you decide when, where, and how you want to use microwave power, which makes the iWavecube the most versatile appliance ever made. If you have a small kitchen or need microwave power on a boat, camper or RV, the iWavecube makes the most of limited space. For yourself, a family member of a BFF, the iWavecube is a great gift anytime of the year. Perfect for the dorm-room because it's the perfect small food microwave!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jjREWk+-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iWavecube","source_asin":"B002Q4V62E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002Q4V62E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002Q4V62E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901308,"name":"Evelots Wire Shelf Dividers-10 Pack-Closet Storage & Organization for Office/Pantry/Garage-Shelf Separator-Easy Clip-No Tool-Plastic Coated Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X99BezBaS._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Custom Organization and Storage: This set of 10 white wire shelf dividers is great for closet organizers and storage shelves and are an important part of functional closet shelf system. It allows you to stack any stackable item neatly. Use as room for separating clothes, shoes, kids toys, bath towels, bags, office supplies, kitchen supplies , tools, shoe organizer, books and more. Space Saving Design: For closet shelves, when you can't move outward, move upward! These wire shelf dividers are a great way to utilize vertical space. Support your stacked items like your tshirts, hoodie, jeans neatly. Keep your closet organized with these dividers that make storage and organization simple. Versatile Use Closet Dividers: This closet shelf organizer offers a versatile storage solution for all your needs from a baby closet organizer, handbags, pants, linens for bed, yoga pants and other clothes, shoes and boot storage. Easily Clips On: This closet storage organizer simply clicks into your existing wire shelving. Easy moving when reorganizing your house. Sturdy shoe storage. The dividers each measuring 12.25 Inches Wide x 10.75 Inches High with prongs 2 Inches Deep. From our Vermont home to yours: For over 10 years, Evelots has offered customers unique products with a 30-day easy return policy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X99BezBaS._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evelots","source_asin":"B07QDNTCRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QDNTCRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QDNTCRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901309,"name":"Market Place Red Grain Sack Stripe Table Runner, 13\" x 36\", Farmhouse Style, Gray and Cream Tabletop Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KD+V+CZZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Table Runner, 13\" x 36\", 100% cotton. ***Please note that we photograph our runners hanging off the side of the table as they show well that way. Please measure your table to make sure you get the length you need! Textured solid cream woven cotton fabric; Single brick red grain sack stripe woven horizontally across center; Flannel lining; Turned edge seam; Reverses to solid cream cotton fabric; Machine wash in cold water with like colors, gentle cycle. No chlorine bleach. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Iron if needed. We've been hearing for some time now that many of you would like to see the Market Place in a true farmhouse red. Well, here it is, and we just know you're going to love it! For this collection, we chose a beautifully textured, substantial weight cotton with a surprisingly soft hand feel. One set of broad woven stripes in muted brick red run down the center of the runner, and make a delightful contrast against the natural cream base. The runner reverses to a soft cream cotton. Visit our Piper Classics Store to find coordinating collection items to complete your ensemble (see link under product name).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KD+V+CZZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Piper Classics","source_asin":"B087VXYKLF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087VXYKLF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087VXYKLF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901310,"name":"Spectrum Wire Small Utility Basket (Satin Nickel Powder Coat) - Storage Bin & Décor for Bathroom, Closet, Pantry, Under Sink, Toy, Shelf, Kitchen, & N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817s9sJbneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add fashionable storage to your home with Spectrum Diversified’s Utility Basket. Designed to look stylish in both modern and rustic farmhouses, the wire grid design is clean and adaptable to the environment. Curved handles add a bit of softness to the rigid lines and make it easier to pull baskets from closet and pantry shelves when needed. With smooth welds and a stylishly designed handle, the well-constructed basket is sturdy enough to hold heavy cans or gardening equipment without scrimping on fashionable details. The clean design works in any room. Straighten up your extra shampoo and conditioner in the bathroom, your non-perishable items in the pantry, your accessories in the closet, painting or sewing supplies in the craft room, or your gardening supplies in the garage. Open wire helps you see what’s inside the basket, so you can easily grab your dog’s favorite toy or your child’s hat without searching endlessly. Use this basket to tidy up your home while adding a stamp of style. Made of sturdy steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817s9sJbneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B0BNW7CNRR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNW7CNRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNW7CNRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901311,"name":"Apple Trees in Flower by Ernest Quost, 35 by 47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815k77t+HFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features apple trees. Ernest Quost was a French Impressionist painter. He painted cityscapes, landscapes, still life, flowers, and fruit. He did many sketches of dances and boulevards that he used in a workshop as a student. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815k77t+HFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00IKF9E7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IKF9E7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IKF9E7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
