window.products.push({"id":901500,"name":"Ternola - RUSSIAN PIPING TIPS + E-GUIDE - Set of 31PCS for Cakes/Cupcakes Flower Decoration (9 Nozzles +1 Leaf Tip + 1 Icing/Frosting Silicon Bag + 20","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812Mhocby+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DO I NEED A COUPLER TO USE RUSSIAN PIPING TIPS? You don't need a coupler, just cut the end of the bag so only 1/8 of the tip is exposed. This will keep the tip in the bag even if you're using very stiff icing and applying a lot of pressure. ARE THOSE TIPS EASY TO USE? YES. It will not take long to learn how to use them. After some practicing your cupcakes will look like they were bought from a bakery. WHAT FROSTING SHOULD I USE TO MAKE MY FLOWERS LOOK GREAT? We provide an E-GUIDE with CUPCAKE and FROSTING RECIPES! It works well with every cream that has stiff consistency. HOW TO CLEAN TIPS? You can use your dishwashing machine or clean easily with a dish soap and hot water. WHAT TYPES OF FLOWERS CAN I MAKE? You can create different styles of Tullips and Roses. ARE THOSE TIPS DESIGNED ONLY FOR CUPCAKE DECORATION? No. Except decorating cupcakes you can also create marvelous flower field on your cake. DIMENSIONS OF TIPS: - Top­ 0,79 inches (20 mm)  - Bottom ­ 1.26 inches (32 mm)  - Height ­ 1.54 inches (39mm) MATERIAL: - Food Grade Eco-­Friendly Stainless Steel  A great gift for the bakers! Every baker will appreciate these Flower Tips. Also perfect gift for family, friends, and other loved ones!  We are trying to make your decorating experience affordable, easier and much more effective! Click the \"ADD TO CART\" button above to improve your baking performance now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812Mhocby+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ternola","source_asin":"B01HH242PW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HH242PW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HH242PW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
