window.products.push({"id":901609,"name":"3-Cup Stainless Steel Flour Sifter,Squeeze Sifter for Baking with Compatable Silicone Handle (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZgSbtg0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.Why Choose us ? YongLy is a Technology company ,always offer good baking products for your kitchen. Our products are Innovative with traditional and modern combined with the new elements. Though kown that there is nothing perfect in the world, we keep chasing the better one. Anna ,as the owner of YongLy, I keep chasing and improving product. I have test and used more then 10 similiar products and more than dozens of time before begin to sell . Moreover, we always pay high attention to customers feedback and according with customers request to improve our goods quality and won users 'recognition. 2.Why Need Baking Tool as Helper ? Since the Choice of baking at home , i believe you would like to enjoy the process and make better cake, pastry.Therefore baking tool flour sifter, rolling pin, mixing bowl , sugar power sifter ,Pastry Mat etc thesedifferent small kitchen tool must be your good helper no matter you are baker or house cooker . 3.Why Choose This Double Mesh Sifter ? a.It is usefull for baking and hand-held.b.It is made of Stainless Steel and siliconec.Flour is finer getting through 2 meshes .d.More fun in baking. 4.Should you be Noticed before buy Some of customers told us the handle is kind of raw and most of them said they could accept the handle which without whole silicone-cover and our handle with part of silicone-cover . And because other similiar products are without any silicone handle completely,they are rawer. Thank you for Choosing us or go through our listing anyway. Enjoy Shpping","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZgSbtg0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QQJ","source_asin":"B083GVTT56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083GVTT56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083GVTT56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901610,"name":"JapanStyle Rice Ball Maker Triangular Onigiri Mold (2 cups) L-8153 57 x 143 x 72 mm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dm+wkwCKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Have you met a problem making an Onigiri / Omusubi, Japanese rice ball with your own hands and given up making it in triangular shape? Or you've already given it up before trying it as it looks too difficult? Making a rice ball actually might be a little more challenging than the way it looks, especially when it includes fillings. This product, Onigiri maker can solve such a problem so easily. All you have to do is just put rice in the cup and press it with the pressing cover part. If you have nori seaweed, it'd be perfect! Wrap the whole rice ball with the piece of nori seaweed or put it on the area you might want to hold with your fingers. Rice hardly gets stuck on the surface of Onigiri maker because of the material (polypropylene) and easy to keep it clean. The best part of this Onigiri maker is that there are 2 Onigiri mold cups! You can make 2 rice balls at the same time! You can always check how the rice ball looks like in the cups because the cups are semi-transparent. Onigiri can be taken out easily and perfect food for a school lunch, office lunch, long drive, picnic and party as alternative to sandwiches!! It is also great to put Onigiri rice balls in a Bento box. Let's make Onigiri rice balls with various kinds of unique fillings and share them with your friends! In Japan, umeboshi, wakame seaweed, kombu, salmon, tuna&mayo, miso, seasoned cod roe, and dried bonito are classic as Onigiri fillings, and it is common to bring Onigiri rice balls as lunch for a school trip and annual sports festival at school. Brown rice, multigrain rice, with red beans... You can make them even healthier!!*Please avoid using a dishwasher machine.*Made of polypropylene*Temperature endurance: 100C - 20C (212F - 4F)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dm+wkwCKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JapanStyle","source_asin":"B0746D6BXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746D6BXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746D6BXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
