window.products.push({"id":901676,"name":"Commercial Deep Fryer With Basket - 2 * 12L Dual Stainless Steel Fryer 2 * 3300W Separate Temperature Control for Contertop Restaurant Home Kitchen 24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JYWPBTX0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dual 3300W Fryer. Separate thermostat control, more power saving. Rated 240V voltage and 1800W+1800W. Heating range is 140-392F. Features with 5 ring heating tube, heating evenly and atractive food color. Double overheating protection. If reaching 464F or the preset temperature, the fryer will automatically shut off. Please note: If two fryers are used at the same time, total power is 6600W. 12L+12L Large Capacity. Upgraded baskets is made of food grade stainless steel and chrome plated. The upper frame is designed with double sides for more solidity and durability. Handle is anti-hot. Hooks can be hung up for filter oil. The two baskets come with two lids. Cover up when not in use to avoid dust. The bottom rack can make the baskets and heating tube isolated, so that the heating is even and supply protection. Easy to Maitain. It is modern and easy to maitain in daily life. The edge is smooth. The 2 baskets, 2 racks, 2 lids, and also the 2 machine heads with heating tube are detachable to clean. Multifunctional Usage. Precise temperature control and thermostatic controls. The cooked food has attractive color after frying. Great for frying fish steak, fries, chicken, pork chops, fish balls and so on. Widely used in fast food store, restaurants, cafeterias, households, etc. Commercial Grade Stainless Steel Material. The 2 fry pot is thickened stainless steel, durable and heavy duty for using. The deep fryer is 570*470*345mm, gross weight 10.6kg, voltage 240V, power 3300+33000W.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JYWPBTX0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Worcest","source_asin":"B0C1TVK2HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1TVK2HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1TVK2HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
