window.products.push({"id":901791,"name":"MOVOYEE Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room Home Baby Kids Whole House Hotel Office Desk Plant,500ml Cute Aromatherapy Portable Ultrasonic Cool Mist Hu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JhP6bFjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MOVOYEE Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room Home Baby Kids Whole House Babies Nursery Small Living Rooms Hotel Office Desk Classroom Plants Yoga Spa,500ml Cute Aromatherapy Diffuser,Portable Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier with Essential Oil Diffuser,Support 14 Modes Changing Color LED Night Light,Remote Control,Auto Shut Off,High Low Mist Output Level,Timer With Remote Control Built with a smart control system.Easy to use with 4 timer setting & remote per what you like. 14-Colors Changing Mode LED Night Light 14 different combinationed lights offer a comforting glow,also can be used as a night light. Quiet This room humidifiers with low noise design,so not be disturbed when sleeping or working. Enjoy Fresh and Fragrant Air -The ultrasonic humidifiers compatible with essential oils,also work as aroma diffusers for essential oils.The powerful long-lasting mist help moisturize the dry air in room,improve sleep quality,moisturize skin alleviate the discomfort.Directly add several drops of essential oil,enjoy long-lasting fragrance,relax your mind immediately & fall asleep faster.-Water Tank: 500ml capacity,large humidifier.Top-fill Design to make filling easier.Semitransparent is convenient to observe the surplus water at any time.-Adjustable Mist Level: Sensitive button for high&low mist modes help you easily change its working mode.-Up to 8-12 hours of operating time with adjustable mist direction and high/low speeds.-Waterless Auto Shut Off,Very Safe. Notes: 1.Oils not included in the package.2.To prolong the lifetime of the item,please keep it try and clean when storing.3.If the water added over max line,the mist will be very thin(less water, more mist)4.If the ultrasonic wave chip was polluted, it may cause error action or default.5.Please don't touch the internal ultrasonic wave vibration board inside of the water tank directly with your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JhP6bFjLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOVOYEE","source_asin":"B0BZVRHBPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZVRHBPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZVRHBPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901792,"name":"Old Cabin by David Lloyd Glover, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71giXoK-gFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features an old cabin. David Lloyd Glover has a 25 year internation reputation exhibiting in major galleries in the US, Canada, Mexico and Japan. His works have been acquired by collectors all over the world. Glover creates masterworks in watercolor on paper, gouache on paper, oil on canvas and acrylic on canvas with equal facility. After a career in the advertising industry he embarked on a full time vocation of creating fine art for gallery sales. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71giXoK-gFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKFKPZE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKFKPZE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKFKPZE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
