window.products.push({"id":901830,"name":"American Pillowcase 2pk 300 Thread Ct Shams Ivory 21x26 Standard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616c+7PtKrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STANDARD PILLOW SHAMS – Perfectly fits a 20” x 26” pillow. Confirm pillow size before ordering. Quantity 2 LUXURY 100% EGYPTIAN COTTON - Shams with 2” flange on all four sides and overlapping fabric in back for finished look HIGHEST QUALITY CONSTRUCTION - Made of 100% combed cotton spun into compact yarns and woven into a 300 thread count fabric. Very rare to use such beautiful yarns for retail sheeting BIO-POLISHED - You’ll feel the fantastic softness at first touch. Sateen weave and MERCERIZED for a beautiful sheen. EASY CARE & PRESHRUNK FOR A PERFECT FIT - Machine wash on cold. Tumble dry on low. Do not use bleach or softeners. Preshrunk for a perfecly snug fit on your pillow, please confirm your pillow size before placing your order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616c+7PtKrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERICAN PILLOWCASE","source_asin":"B01NAUZO6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NAUZO6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NAUZO6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901831,"name":"Cybrtrayd 45St25-K004 Smile Lolly Chocolate Candy Mold with 25 Cybrtrayd 4.5\" Lollipop Sticks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.08,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wTh27Ip4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques. To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision. Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wTh27Ip4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B00EU58BWA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EU58BWA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EU58BWA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
