window.products.push({"id":901860,"name":"Carbon Fiber Bottle Opener Keychain by Centri Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JLZ+25GZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Centri Designs developed the carbon fiber Bottle Opener Keychain with your needs in mind. This material is perfect for exceeding anything you have seen before. We revised the distance of the keychain hole from the edge in version 2.0 to prevent any cracking from occurring. Weighing as much as a nickel, it is incredibly strong and nearly unbendable . This unique bottle opener is only 2mm thick (thickness of a key), yet 5 times stronger than steel and 40% lighter than aluminum. How? Each row of the 3K twill is a bundle of 3,000 individual carbon fibers, each of which measuring at only 1/20th the width of a human hair. Layers of the woven fibers are laid one atop another and then infused with epoxy resin and cured. The result is one of the strongest, most durable substances known to man.   The Bottle Opener Keychain fits neatly on your key ring, pocket, or purse yet adding nearly no weight. This opener features a matte finish on both sides to provide a beautifully silky look and scratch resistance. Carbon fiber is discreet; it will not set off a metal detector while passing through.   One of the distinctive properties of 3K twill carbon fiber is its iridescent, almost holographic, shine. And whether you're using it as a beer bottle opener or just a sleek keychain, the head-turning look creates the perfect conversation starter. Carbon fiber is an unrivaled material for extreme sports, aerospace, and military that you can now carry wherever life takes you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JLZ+25GZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Centri Designs","source_asin":"B017GK29PU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017GK29PU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017GK29PU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
