window.products.push({"id":901979,"name":"Metal Lily Stand Candlestick by Smart Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618feqmiZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metal Lily Stand Candlestick Zingz & Thingz 57071162 They say it's always darkest before the dawn, but not when you have this lovely candleholder glimmering with light! The shimmery golden hue of the conical candle cup will light up your night with warm glow. It's set in a metal base that features elongated leaves and two golden-colored faceted crystalline buds, creating a floral focal point that will shine bright in your decor. Champagne color Dimensions: Overall: 11\" H x 4.37\" W x 4.12\" D Overall Product Weight: 0.4lbs Specifications: Holder Type: Candlestick Style: Contemporary Finish: Champagne/Brown Holder Material Details: Iron and acrylic Holder Material: Glass; Metal; Plastic Number of Items Included: 1 Candle Capacity: 1 Candle Included: No Candle Compatibility: Tealight Chain Included: No Country of Manufacture: China Distressed: Yes Style The Metal Lily Stand Candlestick is a Contemporary style product. Contemporary style bridges the gap between traditional and modern. Pieces feature simple and clean lines with smooth surfaces without any carving or adornment. You can shop for more Contemporary Candle Holders in the Decor section of our site.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618feqmiZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accent Plus","source_asin":"B00HUI6CSE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HUI6CSE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HUI6CSE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901980,"name":"Football Sports Raiders Fans Embroidered Patch Iron on Logo Vest Jacket Cap Hoodie Backpack Patch Iron On/sew on Patch (Shields)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kJ4FvcBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instructions Garment should be clean & freshly laundered for attaching patch. Here are the basic instructions for setting our iron on patches.  Step 1: Set iron to '' COTTON'' , 400 degrees, for one minute.  Step 2: Thoroughly iron area of garment where patch will be placed.  Step 3: Spray water light on the back. Position your patch where you desire, Place it on garment, embroidery facing up.  Step 4: Place cloth or light towel over patch and using a slow circular motion, press firmly for 30 seconds. Step 5: Let cool for one minute. If edge of patch can be lifted, repeat step 5.   Note: You can either sew on or iron on all patches that we sell.  Sew on: 1. First tidy up the clothes that need to be repaired or decorated, and choose the appropriate subsidy to put it in the position you want to repair or decorate;  2. Use the same color needle thread to simply sew the broken clothing (severe need to increase the lining to avoid repairing the clothes and then shape) and then roughly sew the clothes and cloth for positioning;  3. It can also be done by evenly tightening the upper line around the cloth or by using a sewing machine to step on the line.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kJ4FvcBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"APFoo","source_asin":"B08R777DYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R777DYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R777DYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
