window.products.push({"id":901992,"name":"Patina All in One Chip and Dip Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m8yCFNF3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Patina collection is made using gold Leaves burnt using hand Torches to give the iridescent metal look which ends up looking as a Leopard skin pattern naturally caused and made by hand. Each piece is hand made using spun glass technique, once the glass has cooled down we hand decorate each one on the back of the glass starting with gilding the silver, gold or copper Leaves on the surface. Once the surface is cleaned from metal leaf residues, the item is heat cured we then layer organic pigment in steps to each glass piece by hand. As the metal layer soaks the paints in, all items are sealed with a special lacquer to assure its resistance to usage and heated for a final time to cure the item and penetrate all materials on the glass surface. Start to finish each one takes up to 3 hours to create. You can use this piece of art chip & dip tray during your most luxurious dinner party's to serve your guests in a chic and elegant way. You can place vegetables, Sushi, chips or even biscuits on the edge while serving your dipping sauces or sweet creams in the center.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m8yCFNF3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Red Pomegranate","source_asin":"B0144XJBHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0144XJBHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0144XJBHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901993,"name":"Ripeng I Love You Back Wall Art Moon Metal Wall Decorations Hanging Wall Plaque Sign with Love Quote Monogrammed Home Decor for Anniversary Valentine'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CNmHsaErL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material and size: made of metal, metal moon decor sign is weatherproof and lightweight, and also the pretty decoration inside as well as outside of your home; The size is about 12 x 12 inches/ 30 x 30 cm; Right size and beautiful shape can be applied as a gift to package for your relatives and friends; Warm note: it is not your typical steel metal and the material will not rust or fade Decorative moon love quote art: the moon wall sign features with words which makes the sign romantic and warm; It is the nice present for your friends, family, or lover, and a nice way to express your love; Simple monogrammed gift but with full meaning; It also can be applied as room decors, helping you to create sweet loving atmosphere at your home and add more charm of your bedroom Fine workmanship and craftsmanship: the meta wall decoration is made of cold-rolled steel to ensure long-lasting durability; It is cut with advanced laser technology, which gives it exquisite appearance, special style and high accuracy; In addition, the moon wall is decorated with powder-coated metallic black or polished metallic silver, bright and pretty, nice for old-fashioned houses and moon nursery room Gift ideas: the moon decoration embarks a strong sense of love, which can help you win the hearts of your loved ones; On the coming Mother's Day, you can gift your dear mother; As a cute gift, it is suitable for many occasions, such as Mother's day Valentine's day, birthday, wedding, housewarming, Father's day and more; What are you waiting for, send it out quickly Wide range of usages: the moon decor is nice for decorating your home walls and mantels as well as outside; Suitable for front doors, patio, eaves, pool areas, barns/workshops, gates, and more, letting your home be shine and eye-catching","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CNmHsaErL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ripeng","source_asin":"B091KV8XQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091KV8XQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091KV8XQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901994,"name":"Himalayan Trading Post Small Wooden Candle Tray Red Currant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dnFoEViaL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Decorate your home with the small wooden candle tray red currant from Himalayan Trading Post. Handmade in small batches, Himalayan Trading Post candles are made with a clean and long burning wax blend that burns away to leave a decorative container that can be reused. Himalayan candles are inspired by love of the old and bring together vintage inspired containers, varied in styles but drawn together in a common thread. The fragrances are saturated with layers of nuance in a high ration to ensure a fragrant candle burn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dnFoEViaL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Himalayan Trading Post","source_asin":"B01M0UAQG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M0UAQG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M0UAQG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
