window.products.push({"id":901997,"name":"100% Cotton Bath Towels Set - Grey 27\"x54\" Pack of 4 Ultra Soft Large Bath Towel 100% Cotton Bath Towel Set Highly Absorbent Daily Usage Bath Towel Id","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MeM5PkIfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% COTTON MATERIAL - Premium cotton Bath towels made from 100% high quality ringspun cotton with Light Weight & Absorbent material. These luxurious quality Bath Towels give you the ensuing plush experience, ultra-absorbency and super soft bath towels allow you to feel spa grandeur in the comfort of your own home. PACK Of 4 TOWELS - Treat yourself to some luxury and comfort. Pack of 4 Bath Towels each measuring 27 by 54 inches in Grey Color, with double stitched hems for longevity and durability. PERFECT FOR HOME SPA GYM - Luxury towel set add a touch of elegance to any décor, ideal for Home, spa, salon, resort, hotels/Motels, and gym or sauna even perfect for the beach or pool. MACHINE INSTRUCTION - Wash your towels before the first use to remove any excess lint leftover from the manufacturing process. We advise against the use of fabric softeners which may reduce absorbency and may cause discoloration. Machine wash these towels with like colors or better if you wash your towels separately to avoid transfer of lint onto your garments. GREAT BUY - Set of 4 bath towels measuring 27X54 inches, these excellent and functional measurements are ideal for the everyday purposes of these towels. You'll enjoy the softness, absorbency, luxurious, lightweight, and durability as tightly woven towels can quickly wick moisture from your body.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MeM5PkIfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RIZARIES","source_asin":"B085RBVYQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085RBVYQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085RBVYQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":901998,"name":"Bernardin Mason Jar Lids & Screw Bands - Wide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410d5MhmyzL._AC_.jpg","description":"These metal SNAP lids and screw bands for mason jars seal home canned foods airtight. After heat processing and upon cooling, a vacuum is formed which seals the lids onto the jars. The lids are laquered to prevent rust and have an interior enamel coating to resist natural food acidity. Pack of 12 lids and 12 screw bandsSize: Wide mouth (86 mm) Colour/Pattern: Silver-toneDimensions: 86 mm DiaScrew bands can be reused, but SNAP lids are designed for one-time use only.~For best results, fill hot jar with prepared recipes, leaving recommended headspace. Wipe jar rim and threads with a clean, damp cloth removing any stickiness. Center hot SNAP lid on jar. Apply screw band just until fingertip tight; do not overtighten. After processing, remove jars from canner and set upright on a towel in a draft-free place. Do not retighten screw bands or check for seal while jars are hot. Cool processed jars upright, undisturbed for 24 hours. After 24 hours, check seals. Sealed lids curve downward and do not move when pressed. (Any unsealed jars should be reprocessed or refrigerated.) For all sealed jars, remove screw bands; wipe and dry bands and jars. Store screw bands separately or replace loosely on jars, as desired.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410d5MhmyzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bernardin","source_asin":"B000G6XVNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-901998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000G6XVNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000G6XVNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
